# Pairs with ReadableOnceComplete. #4545's second fix (#4644) with its witness
# held in activation memory only: a reactivation loses the record that the
# saga's terminal settled the key, so an unstamped marker arriving afterwards
# is installed and gates the key after the saga completed.
MODULE: ReadableOnceCompleteWitnessNotDurable
TARGET: ReadableOnceComplete
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a reactivation loses the witness, so a later unstamped marker gates the key after the saga completed
PERTURBS: Reactivate

--- FIND
    /\ lk /\ ~term[c][s] /\ ~wit
    /\ row[c][s][k] < SagaV
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the marker carries no prepare stamp.
    /\ lk /\ ~term[c][s] /\ ~wit
--- END

--- FIND
    /\ UNCHANGED <<alias, rmap, published, rmapR, rmapOld, row, sp, spCopy, rz, rzShards, fence, redir, sg, bound, prepped, told, dec, masked, forgotten, wit, late, wDone, ackOn>>
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the witness is not durable.
    /\ wit' = FALSE
    /\ UNCHANGED <<alias, rmap, published, rmapR, rmapOld, row, sp, spCopy, rz, rzShards, fence, redir, sg, bound, prepped, told, dec, masked, forgotten, late, wDone, ackOn>>
--- END